    "headline": "Chevron Reports Second Quarter 2026 Results",
    "summary": "HOUSTON, July 31, 2026--Chevron Corporation (NYSE: CVX) reported earnings of $12.1 billion ($6.11 per share - diluted) for second quarter 2026. Included in the quarter were an asset sale gain of $230 million and pension settlement costs of $86 million. Foreign currency effects decreased earnings by $49 million. Adjusted earnings were $12.0 billion ($6.06 per share - diluted) for second quarter 2026. See Attachment 4 for a reconciliation of adjusted earnings.",
